<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <style>
      table {
        border-collapse: collapse;
        width: 100%;
      }
      
      th, td {
        text-align: left;
        padding: 8px;
      }
      
      tr:nth-child(even){background-color: #f2f2f2}
      
      th {
        background-color: #04AA6D;
        color: white;
      }
      .header {
  padding: 60px;
  text-align: center;
  background: #1abc9c;
  color: white;
  font-size: 30px;
}
      </style>
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <link rel='stylesheet' href='/stylesheets/style.css' />
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="header">
      <h2><h1><%= title %></h1>
        <p>여기는 댓글을 쓸 수 있고 글쓴것을 볼 수 있는 곳이야</p></h2>
    </div>
    <ul class="navbar-nav"></ul>
    <a href="/" class="nav-link">홈으로 돌아가기</a></li>
    <ul class="navbar-nav">
    </ul>
    <table>
      <tr>
        <th><h1>제목 : <%=board.title%> </h1></th>
      <tr>
      <td> <h3>글쓴이 : <%=board.contents%> </h3>
        <h3>내용 : <%=board.author%> </h3></td>
      </tr>
      </table>
    <hr>
    <ul class="navbar-nav"></ul>
    <a href="/" class="nav-link">홈으로 돌아가기</a></li>
    <ul class="navbar-nav">
    </ul>
    
    <table>
      <tr>
        <th>댓글</th>
      <tr>
      <td><% if (board.comments !== null) {
        var comment = board.comments;
          for(var i = 0; i < board.comments.length; i++) {%>
    <h4>작성자 : <%=comment[i].author%></h4>
    <h4>내용 : <%=comment[i].contents%></h4>
    <hr>
    <%}}%> </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

    <table>
      <tr>
        <th>댓글 쓰는 곳.</th>
      <tr>
      <td> <h3><form action="/comment/write" method="post">
        <input type="text" name="id" value="<%=board._id%>" hidden>
        글 : <textarea name="contents"></textarea><br>
        글쓴이 : <input type="text" name="author"><br>
        <input type="submit" value="확인">
      </form> </h3></td>
    </tr>
    </table>

    
  </body>
</html>